        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[From a bold vision in 2009 to a global powerhouse in 2025, Centro has transformed the landscape of Business Process Outsourcing (BPO) and Customer Experience (CX) solutions. Founded by industry pioneer Hesham Farag in Fairfax, Virginia, Centro was built on the belief that outsourcing should be more than just a cost-saving tactic; it should be a strategic advantage that elevates brands, enhances customer journeys, and fuels business growth.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
